===The Mimic Circle===
The south end of the route holds a large field of [[long grass]]. Hidden within are six Trainers who call themselves the Mimic Circle. When a traveler passes by, these Trainers like to make fun by copying the traveler's movements. 

===Weather Institute===
Located on the north end of the route, the [[Weather Institute]] is a research facility used to study the weather patterns of the [[Hoenn]] region. This data seems to have drawn the attention of [[Team Magma]]{{sup/3|R}}/[[Team Aqua]]{{sup/3|S}}, as a pair of Grunts has been stationed at the bridge outside.

