====1F====
Inside, you find another pair of Grunts searching the back room. Before taking them on, you can visit the break room to the northwest; the comfy bed can be used to rest your Pokémon, and the PC can be used to organize your party. Defeat the Grunts and climb up the stairs.

====2F====
On the second floor, you find another pair of Grunts. Battle past them to find that the researchers are being held captive by [[Courtney]]{{sup/3|R}}/[[Shelly]]{{sup/3|S}}, the second of the villainous team's Admins. The group is here looking for information on extreme weather conditions, and to steal a Pokémon rumored to have been created by the Institute that can control the weather. She can't allow you to meddle in their plans, and draws you into battle.

