====The Threat Continues====
[[Courtney]]{{sup/3|R}}/[[Shelly]]{{sup/3|S}} simply shrugs off her defeat, declaring that the team has other plans to advance before she and her subordinates flee the building. As thanks for their rescue, one of the Scientists rewards you with a {{p|Castform}}, a Pokémon created by the [[Weather Institute]] that changes its {{DL|Castform (Pokémon)|Form data|form}} based on the current weather conditions.

===Meet up with May/Brendan===
Leave the [[Weather Institute]] and go east to cross the northern bridge. As you go to climb up the nearest stairway, {{ga|May}}/{{ga|Brendan}} catches up to you. Your friend wants to see how much stronger you've become, and wastes no time challenging you to a battle!

