===Fly Like a Bird===
{{ga|May}}/{{ga|Brendan}} was worried that you may not have been keeping up with your training, but your victory proves these fears unfounded. As a reward, she/he presents you with {{HM|02|Fly}}. This field move allows a Trainer to quickly return to any familiar location—but to use it, you will need to earn the Gym Badge from nearby [[Fortree City]] first. The young Trainer suggests flying home to visit {{ho|Mom}} in [[Littleroot Town]], before biking northward up the hill.

==Fortree City==
[[File:Fortree City RS.png|thumb|250px|Fortree City]]

Located between Routes {{rtn|119|Hoenn}} and {{rtn|120|Hoenn}}, [[Fortree City]] was built in an old-growth forest with dense plant life. The ancient trees found here are so large that the residents were able to build cozy homes among their branches. The [[Fortree Gym]] stands in the heart of the city, and a shop offering Secret Base decorations can be found in the southeast part of town.

