===Time for a Trade===
Visit the northwest treehouse to find a girl who would like to [[trade]] Pokémon. She is willing to part with her {{p|Skitty}} in exchange for a {{p|Pikachu}}. Skitty arrives holding a piece of [[Glitter Mail]].

===Reveal Your Hidden Power===
The north-northwest house belongs to an elderly woman. Speak to her to play her guessing game: she holds a coin in her hand, and asks in which one you believe it to be hidden. Guess correctly three times (Right, Right, Left) to win the game and receive {{TM|10|Hidden Power}}. This unique attack changes its type and power based on the Pokémon using it.

===An Invisible Barrier===
Something invisible blocks the way to the clearing that holds the [[Fortree Gym]]. Earning the sixth Badge will need to wait!

===Running Errands===
Visit the northeast treehouse and speak to the young man inside. As you do, he directs his {{p|Wingull}} to run an errand for him, and the Seagull Pokémon exits the building. Return later to find out if it was successful!

===Secret Base shop===
The southeast treehouse holds {{DL|Fortree City|Desk and chair shop|a shop}} with a variety of [[Secret Base]] [[decoration]]s for sale. Desks can be purchased at the counter to the left, while chairs can be purchased at the counter to the right.

