==Route 120==
===Reveal the Unseen===
With an invisible force blocking the [[Fortree Gym]], there is no choice but to continue eastward to {{rt|120|Hoenn}}. Proceed to the northernmost bridge, where you happen to run into [[Steven Stone|Steven]] again. He informs you that there is another invisible force here, blocking travel to the bridge's west end. Fortunately, he has a way to solve this mystery, and asks if your Pokémon are ready for battle. When ready, Steven slips on the [[Devon Scope]], a high-tech piece of eyewear that reveals invisible objects. Sure enough, they expose a wild {{p|Kecleon}} standing in front of you, and the startled Pokémon attacks! Catch or defeat the Pokémon to clear the bridge. Pleased with your actions, Steven allows you to keep the device. This allows you to chase the other Kecleon away from the Gym, so head back into town to win your next Badge!

